---
import { policyDates } from '../data/legal';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="InsureFacts has no accounts or forms and doesn't collect personal data directly. Learn how Google AdSense uses cookies and how to manage your choices."
  lead="We don’t ask for, or directly collect, your personal data. This page explains the limited ways information is processed when you visit."
  updated={policyDates.privacy}
  ads={false}
>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    InsureFacts ({site.domain}) is operated by {site.ownerName}, based in {site.ownerLocation}. For
    any privacy question or request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don’t collect</h2>
  <p>
    InsureFacts has no user accounts, logins, sign-ups, newsletters or forms, and no database of
    visitors. We don’t ask for your name, address, email or any other personal details.
  </p>

  <h2>If you email us</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose to email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in your
    message. We use it only to reply to you or to act on a correction, and we don’t keep it for
    longer than we need to. We never sell or share it for marketing. Please don’t send sensitive
    information such as policy numbers or health details.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted by Cloudflare. To deliver pages and protect the site from attacks,
    Cloudflare processes technical information such as IP addresses and browser details. See{' '}
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      Cloudflare’s privacy policy
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
  <p>
    When ads are shown on InsureFacts, they are served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners
    use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads, to limit how often you see an ad, and to
    measure ad performance. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on
    your previous visits to this website and other websites. Google’s use of advertising cookies
    enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and other sites on
    the internet.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      Read{' '}
      <a
        href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services
      </a>
      .
    </li>
    <li>
      You can turn off personalised advertising from Google in{' '}
      <a href="https://myadcenter.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        My Ad Center
      </a>
      .
    </li>
    <li>
      You can opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalised advertising at{' '}
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        aboutads.info
      </a>
      .
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>InsureFacts does not see or control the information Google collects through these cookies.</p>

  <h2>Your consent choices</h2>
  <p>
    If you visit from the United Kingdom, the European Economic Area or Switzerland, a consent
    message provided through Google (a Google-certified consent management platform) asks for your
    choices before cookies are used for personalised advertising. Where required by law in other
    places, such as some US states, a message may let you opt out. You can change your choices at
    any time using the privacy and cookie settings link that the message provides.
  </p>

  <h2>Theme preference</h2>
  <p>
    If you switch between light and dark mode, your choice is saved in your browser’s local storage
    so the site remembers it. It stays on your device and is never sent to us.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on where you live, you may have rights over your personal data, such as the right to
    access, correct or delete it, or to object to how it is used. Because we don’t hold personal
    data other than emails you send us, most requests about advertising data should go to Google
    using the links above. For anything we hold, email us. You also have the right to complain to
    your local data protection authority, such as the Information Commissioner’s Office (ICO) in the
    UK.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>InsureFacts is intended for adults and is not directed at children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    If we change how information is handled, we’ll update this page and the “Last updated” date
    above.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
